              "media": {
                "disableImageZooming": false
              },
              "taskDescription": "<p>Different modes of administration are absorbed at different rates, and that is important because it has implications on the number of side effects that will be likely and the speed at which the drug is metabolised. This excercise makes sure that you understand the approximate speed with which each method of administration is absorbed.&nbsp;</p>\n",
              "overallFeedback": [
                {
                  "from": 0,
                  "to": 100
                }
              ],
              "checkAnswer": "Check",
              "submitAnswer": "Submit",
